      "cls": "pill rv in",
      "text": "How I review"
    },
    {
      "t": "h1",
      "text": "Four steps,\nthe same way every time"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Every review on this site was made this way: public pages only, every claim dated, and a working fix at the end. Here’s the whole process."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "kl",
      "text": "The toolkit"
    },
    {
