    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "01 · Crawl"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Read it like a machine"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Sitemap, robots, canonicals, titles, schema and prices, pulled from the public HTML the way a crawler or an answer engine sees it. Nothing behind a login."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02 · Evidence"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Date every claim"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Every finding carries the date, the URL and the check behind it, so anyone can re-run it and see if it’s been fixed. Opinions don’t go in; observations do."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03 · Prototype"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Build the fix"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "A scanner, a template, a rewritten page or a working browser. Something a team can use on Monday, not a list of recommendations."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "04 · Plan"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Sequence the work"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "A 30/60/90 plan that puts template fixes first, because one template change usually fixes hundreds of pages at once."
    },
    {
