      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "pill rv in",
      "text": "The playbook"
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "36 checks,\nsix families"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Not every check runs on every site. These are the ones that found the problems in the reviews on this site."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Pricing & promos"
    },
    {
      "t": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Price on page vs cart",
        "Bundle rules that conflict",
        "Deal % named vs configured",
        "Expired promos still live",
        "Contest dates and rules",
        "Volume ladders"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Structured data"
    },
    {
      "t": "ul",
      "items": [
        "JSON-LD on key templates",
        "Product, FAQPage, Organization",
        "LocalBusiness and store schema",
        "GTIN and MPN in Product",
        "Review counts that agree",
        "llms.txt and AI signals"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Indexing & crawl"
    },
    {
      "t": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Canonicals to the right host",
        "Sitemap returns XML",
        "Staging or test pages indexed",
        "Redirects left in sitemaps",
        "Duplicate titles and descriptions",
        "Confirmation pages indexable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Catalog data"
    },
    {
      "t": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Encoding artifacts in names",
        "Facet values split by spelling",
        "Sold-out products still published",
        "Duplicate listings and handles",
        "Attributes leaking into titles",
        "Identifiers and SKUs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Local & store data"
    },
    {
      "t": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Name, address, phone agree",
        "Hours across three sources",
        "tel: links that work",
        "Placeholder numbers indexed",
        "Store pages that exist",
        "Status: open vs coming soon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Launch & speed"
    },
    {
      "t": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Domains connected",
        "Password or parked pages",
        "Analytics tags present",
        "Mobile LCP and CLS",
        "Help-center coverage",
        "Go-live gate you can click"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "pill rv in",
      "text": "Anatomy"
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Five parts of\nevery finding"
    },
    {
      "t": "ol",
      "items": [
        "1\nTitle\n\nA plain sentence that names the defect, not the category.",
        "2\nEvidence\n\nWhere it was seen and the exact values, copied from the page or schema.",
        "3\nDate\n\nWhen it was observed, so it can be re-checked later.",
        "4\nImpact\n\nWhy a shopper, a crawler or the revenue team would care.",
        "5\nFix\n\nThe smallest change that closes it, usually at the template."
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "tag b",
      "text": "Pricing"
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "mono",
      "text": "jarscannabis.com · Lansing"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Two prices for the same seven-cart bundle"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "At Lansing, 14 products carry both 7/$80 Cartridges 2g and 7/$90 Cartridges 2g at once; at Ann Arbor, 11 (Mitten Extracts “Super Nurdz”, “Rainbow Sherbert”, “Blueberry Pie” cartridges among them). Same quantity, two totals, one product."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "OBSERVED"
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "IMPACT"
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "b",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "FIX"
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "pill",
      "text": "Timeline"
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Two days,\nstart to finish"
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "when",
      "text": "Day 1 · morning"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Crawl"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Sitemap, robots, templates, schema and prices pulled and counted."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "when",
      "text": "Day 1 · afternoon"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Evidence"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Findings written, dated and sourced. Anything unproven is cut."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "when",
      "text": "Day 2 · morning"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Prototype"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The scanner, template or working browser that proves the fix."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "when",
      "text": "Day 2 · afternoon"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Plan & publish"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "A 30/60/90 plan, then the review goes live as its own site."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "pill rv in",
      "text": "Deliverables"
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "What every review\nhands over"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Five things, every time. The tool is the part most reviews skip."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Findings site"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "A standalone review site with every finding, dated."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "A working tool"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Scanner, linter, generator or browser built for that site."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Rewrites"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Titles, descriptions, schema or copy, ready to paste."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "04"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "30/60/90 plan"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "What to fix first, second and third."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "05"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Evidence log"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Every claim with its date, source and re-run command."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "pill rv in",
      "text": "Rules"
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Four rules\nevery review follows"
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Public pages only"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "No logins, no scraping behind walls, no private data. If a shopper or a crawler can’t see it, it isn’t in the review."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Template before page"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "One template fix usually beats a hundred page fixes. Findings are grouped by the template that causes them."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Numbers over adjectives"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "“43 sold-out products still published” instead of “inventory issues”. Every figure is counted, not estimated."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "04"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Dated and re-runnable"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Each claim ships with the date and the check behind it, so it can be verified or closed later."
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "FAQs"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "About the reviews and how they’re made."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "summary",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "What is a review here?"
